<!--
	Context menu (mockup PassepartoutDialog): a small paper card over the page dimmed with ink 62%.
	Header: the item's matted print (100x150), "Options", the title in Geist Light 64, the artist line;
	a hairline; rows in Geist 28 on 68px, the ink placard on focus.
	Id contract (Estuary Omega): Kodi clones button template 1000 into grouplist 996 (ids 1001...) and
	resizes image 999 keeping the gap between the grouplist's bottom and 999's bottom. 999 is the whole
	card in one 9-slice (shadow, edge, fill: pp/card_full.png) tinted with the paper colour; the 40% white
	that lightens the card is drawn per row (one strip per cloned button, plus button 990's) so it follows the size too.
	<origin> stops Kodi centring the menu on the focused control; the card centres itself (each extra
	row lifts it 34px).
-->
